Role: Senior Product Design (Figma Productivity)
Location: Remote, Portugal
Required skills:

• At least 6 years of professional experience in a similar role

• Advanced mastery of Figma-specifically Auto Layout, components, variants, component properties, variables, styles, and libraries-building structured, reusable, and maintainable files.

• Experience working with Design Systems, understanding the relationship between components, variants, patterns, and tokens, as well as knowing when to reuse a component versus proposing a new variant.

• Solid background in web and app interaction design, including responsive behavior, platform conventions, and states (loading, error, empty, success, and unavailable).

• Analytical and documentation skills, describing discrepancies clearly, objectively, and constructible for both designers and developers.

